@startuml SSD-S2-release-held-stock
' System sequence diagram for UC-03 Release held stock, slice S2
' Black-box view: one actor, the system as a single lifeline, system events and returned outcomes only
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

title SSD-S2 Release held stock (UC-03)

actor "Hub staff member" as A
participant ":KerryHubSystem" as S

A -> S : listHeldLots()
S --> A : list of HeldLotView (lotId, product, producer,\n batch, held quantity)

A -> S : recordQualityCheck(lotId, released: Quantity,\n  rejected: Quantity, reason)
alt valid and permitted
  S --> A : QualityCheckResult (available, held, written off)
else lot does not exist
  S --> A : Failure(NOT_FOUND)
else volunteer, or non-manager rejects (1a, 4c)
  S --> A : Failure(NOT_PERMITTED)
else lot has no held quantity (3a)
  S --> A : Failure(INVALID_STATE)
else more than held, both zero, or reject with no reason (4d, 4e)
  S --> A : Failure(INVALID_QUANTITY)
end

note over A, S
  listHeldLots only reads data, so it has no operation contract.
  recordQualityCheck changes state: contract OC-05.
end note
@enduml